{"t":"CLX","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"The Clorox Company","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","employees":9200,"hq":"Oakland, CA, United States","website":"https://www.thecloroxcompany.com","summary_en":"The Clorox Company manufactures and markets consumer and professional products worldwide. It operates through four segments: Health and Wellness, Household, Lifestyle, and International. The company home care cleaning and disinfecting products and laundry additives, skin sanitization and cleaning products, professional cleaning and disinfecting products, and professional food service products under the Clorox, Clorox2, Pine-Sol, Scentiva, Tilex, Liquid-Plumr, Formula 409, Purell, GOJO, CloroxPro, Clorox Healthcare, Hidden Valley, Poett, Clorinda, and Chux brands. It also provides bags and wraps, cat litter, and grilling products under the Glad, Fresh Step, Scoop Away, Kingsford, and Ever Clean brands; and dressings, dips, seasonings, sauces, water-filtration products, and natural personal care products under the Brita and Burt's Bees brands. The company sells its products through mass retailers; grocery outlets; warehouse clubs; dollar stores; home hardware centers; drug, pet, and military stores; third-party and owned e-commerce channels; distributors; and other retail outlets through direct sales force. The company was founded in 1913 and is headquartered in Oakland, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Clorox Company는 전 세계적으로 소비자 및 전문가용 제품을 제조 및 판매합니다. 건강 및 웰니스, 가정, 라이프스타일, 국제 등 4개 부문으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 Clorox, Clorox2, Pine-Sol, Scentiva, Tilex, Liquid-Plumr, Formula 409, Purell, GOJO, CloroxPro, Clorox Healthcare, Hidden Valley, Poett, Clorinda 및 Chux 브랜드의 홈 케어 청소 및 소독 제품과 세탁 첨가제, 피부 위생 및 청소 제품, 전문 청소 및 소독 제품, 전문 식품 서비스 제품을 판매하고 있습니다. 또한 Glad, Fresh Step, Scoop Away, Kingsford 및 Ever Clean 브랜드로 가방 및 랩, 고양이 모래 및 그릴 제품을 제공합니다. Brita 및 Burt's Bees 브랜드의 드레싱, 딥, 조미료, 소스, 물 여과 제품 및 천연 개인 관리 제품 등이 있습니다. 회사는 대량 소매점을 통해 제품을 판매합니다. 식료품점; 창고 클럽; 달러 상점; 가정용 하드웨어 센터; 마약, 애완동물, 군용품 상점; 제3자 및 소유 전자상거래 채널; 유통업체; 그리고 직접 판매 인력을 통해 다른 소매점. 이 회사는 1913년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 오클랜드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":105.53,"mcap":12762606592.0,"pe":18.980215,"fpe":17.07072,"peg":1.2515,"ps":1.7735695,"pb":-327.7329,"ev_ebitda":13.631,"div":5.0,"beta":0.581,"hi52":128.9,"lo52":79.12},"fin":{"rev":7196000256.0,"rev_g":0.333,"eps_g":1.138,"gross":0.41939998,"op":0.13543001,"net":0.09408,"roe":5.34363,"fcf":207124992.0,"cash":184000000.0,"debt":5593999872.0,"de":4623.14,"eps":5.56,"feps":6.18193},"own":{"short":0.097799994,"inst":0.88961,"insider":0.0069199996},"analyst":{"n":16,"mean":97.75,"median":96.0,"high":154.0,"low":74.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.11111,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":14,"sell":1,"strongSell":2},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":14,"sell":2,"strongSell":2},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":14,"sell":2,"strongSell":2},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":14,"sell":2,"strongSell":2}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":94.0,"priorPriceTarget":87.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":86.0,"priorPriceTarget":83.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":96.0,"priorPriceTarget":91.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":90.0,"priorPriceTarget":85.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"In-Line","FromGrade":"Underperform","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","cu